    "commentLang": "pt",
    "comment": "Before the procedure began, the patient showed intermittent complete atrioventricular block on the monitor. Despite the\ncrimper's guidance not to release the prosthesis and to first reposition the pigtail catheter and the prosthesis for correct\ndeployment, the physician released it far above the aortic annulus. After several valve-in-valve attempts, the patient\nexperienced cardiac arrest and died.",
